ar thus  no americans have to die again due to  wars  junior points his gun at clay attempting  to kill him but henry stops him as he  doesn't want him to feel the same  remorse and trauma from killing people  he grabs the gun and kills the ceo  himself  the gemini program is subsequently shut  down and every clone has been taken care  of at the end of the movie henry meets  danny at the college where junior now  has changed his name into jackson brogan  which is henry's mother's maiden name  finally has his official identity and  intends to pursue his future in the  engineering world  subscribe to watch more videos like this  turn on notifications and leave a like  to help the channel out thank you for  watching

